      "text": "You saved an object as JSON and a field just vanished?"
    },
    {
      "id": "bug",
      "text": "Most devs miss this."
    },
    {
      "id": "why",
      "text": "JSON dot stringify drops undefined, and turns a Date into a string."
    },
    {
      "id": "fix",
      "text": "Use null for empty values. Store dates as ISO strings, and rebuild them with a reviver in JSON dot parse. Nothing gets lost."
    },
    {
      "id": "bait",
      "text": "ISO strings, or a date library? Comment your answer."
    },
